:name: TEST-PIX-032 — invoke falcon rate@0.7.0#tick on emulated RT1176 Cortex-M7
:description: Boots the harness, which applies the embedder obligations and calls the
:description: cascade stage, then parks the returned torque at 0x20011000 for the oracle.

using sysbus
mach create "invoke"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @hardware/renode/pixhawk6xrt.repl
sysbus LoadELF @.scratch/invoke/invoke.elf
emulation RunFor "0.2"
pause
echo "INVOKE_BEGIN"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20011000
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20011004
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20011008
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x2001100C
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20011010
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20011014
echo "INVOKE_END"
echo "PC"
cpu PC
echo "INSNS"
cpu ExecutedInstructions
